                <div class="card insight"><span class="ico">🪵</span><div><div class="insight-head"><h3>Keep the floor</h3><span class="pill">Low waste</span></div><p>The timber looks sound. <b>Sanding and oiling</b> beats replacement on cost and carbon.</p></div></div>
                <div class="card insight"><span class="ico">🎨</span><div><div class="insight-head"><h3>Refresh the walls</h3><span class="pill">Healthier air</span></div><p>Breathable mineral paint has <b>near-zero VOCs</b> and helps regulate humidity.</p></div></div>
                <div class="card insight"><span class="ico">🧶</span><div><div class="insight-head"><h3>Soften with textiles</h3><span class="pill clay">Quick win</span></div><p>Recycled wool and linen add <b>warmth and acoustics</b> with no building work.</p></div></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="page-actions">
            <button class="btn btn-ghost" data-go="upload">← Back</button>
            <button class="btn btn-primary" id="toIdeas" data-go="ideas" disabled>See renovation ideas <span class="arrow">→</span></button>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- IDEAS -->
